# Docker build-context hygiene for the monorepo images (context = repo root,
# shared by apps/api/Dockerfile and apps/portal/Dockerfile). Everything here is
# either regenerated inside the image or must never ship in it.

# Dependencies + build outputs (reinstalled / rebuilt in the builder stage)
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/out
**/build

# Git + agent worktrees (each worktree is a full repo copy) + scratch workspace
.git
.gitignore
.claude
.intermediate

# Local data + secrets — never baked into an image
**/.data
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Editor / OS / logs / test artifacts
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
**/coverage
.vscode
.idea

# Docs & markdown — reference material, never needed in the runtime image
docs
manuals
**/*.md
